@owner: mason
@stability: stable
@since: 2026-06-09
@reviewed: 2026-06-09

Feature: CLI Entrypoint
  "Boots the mason CLI and maps command failures to a non-zero exit."

  Provides:
    - main.main @source("symbol:main")

  Consumes:
    - cli.Execute

  Invariants:
    - main MUST delegate all CLI behavior to cli.Execute and only map errors to exit code 1

  OutOfScope:
    - Command parsing, subcommand wiring, and service orchestration (owned by internal/cli)

  Scenario (happy-path): Successful invocation
    Given cli.Execute returns nil
    When main runs
    Then the process exits with code 0

  Scenario (negative): Command failure
    Given cli.Execute returns an error
    When main runs
    Then the process exits with code 1
